<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:10.910
<v><b>M:</b></v> What’s eight plus thirteen minus two?

00:00:12.838 --> 00:00:13.655
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:14.426 --> 00:00:16.775
<v><b>F:</b></v> What’s thirty-six divided by twelve?

00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:19.436
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:20.206 --> 00:00:22.079
<v><b>M:</b></v> What’s two thirds of eighteen?

00:00:24.021 --> 00:00:24.783
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:25.648 --> 00:00:29.598
<v><b>F:</b></v> What’s nought point two five multiplied by thirty-six?

