<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:39.486 --> 00:00:41.579
<v><b>F:</b></v> What’s the square root of sixteen?

00:00:43.507 --> 00:00:44.221
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:45.047 --> 00:00:47.314
<v><b>M:</b></v> How many kilometres are there in a mile?

00:00:49.195 --> 00:00:50.044
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:00:50.956 --> 00:00:53.861
<v><b>F:</b></v> Which is longer, an inch or a centimetre?

00:00:55.845 --> 00:00:56.532
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.008
<v><b>M:</b></v> Is seventy-three an odd number or an even number?